\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Producer/consumer seam defects worked through in this paper. The split matters more than the count: the top three are \emph  {agreements} --- both sides consistent, both wrong --- which no parity test can detect, and which is why provenance rather than parity is the load-bearing instrument. The last row names parity's own limit: a harness that forces real perception every tick cannot see a defect that only exists on dream ticks.}}{9}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
